## Requirements
- Write exactly the scene defined by its Title and Description below; stay inside this scene and do not advance other plotlines or skip ahead in time.
- Keep every character consistent with their established traits, speech patterns, and motivations, and honor their state transitions.
- When there is previous content, match its narrative voice, tense, and point of view, and never repeat or contradict anything already written.
- Output ONLY the scene prose as plain paragraphs — no headings, no title, no blockquotes, no JSON, no commentary, no summary.

